          "The connection is personal. Each team member connects their own account, and Claude always acts with that team member's permissions, exactly the ones they have on the screens. An Ankora internal provider can record time only for themselves; reading other team members' time requires management permission, exactly as on the \"Time entries\" screen. There is no single shared company connection, and there is no way to act through Claude on behalf of another user.",
